hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"40","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Jumah ke din ki subah mein pehli rakat mein ""Alif Laam Meem Tanzeel"" aur dusri rakat mein ""Hal ataa alal insaan..."" padhte the."
"41","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sote nahi the jab tak ""Alif Laam Meem Tanzeel"" aur ""Tabaarak allazi biyadihil mulk"" na padh lete."
"42","[AI-translation] Ahmad ne kaha: Haddasana Abul Mughirah, haddasana Safwan, haddathani al-Mashyakhatu ke woh Ghudaif bin Harith ath-Thumali ke paas hazir the jab unki jaan nikalne ki shiddat ho gayi. Unhone kaha: Kya tum mein se koi hai jo Yaseen padhe? Kaha: Toh Saleh bin Shuraih as-Sakooni ne padhi, pas jab un mein se chalees pohanchi toh unka wisaat ho gaya. Kaha: Toh mashyakha kehte the ke jab mayyat ke paas padhi jaye toh is se us par halka kar diya jata hai. (Safwan ne kaha): Aur Isa bin Al-Mu'tamir ne Ibn Ma'bad ke paas padhi."
